00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
With Rabbe Udah, the son of the Rabbat.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
I'm sorry, Rabbe Is'haq, the son of the Rabbat.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The son of the Rabbat, the arch-enemy of Al-Ambam,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
is the teacher of...

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
What does it make it more Medusa?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The Gemariot are not as trustworthy as those of...

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Because it makes no sense.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Wait!

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.000
I have patience.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.000
What is the proof of Rabbeinu Yonah?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
That the...

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
How do you know that this is...

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.000
How do you know that this is...

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Logic!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
But how is it possible

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.000
