00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:52.000
Not that he assumed that he had the correct one.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.000
No.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.000
It makes more sense.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:56.000
It means.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.000
The Nusra of Hakeem Es-Saffat.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.000
It's more precise.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.000
So absolutely he believed it was edited.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.000
For a good reason.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.000
It was edited for a good reason.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.000
Why? Because it makes no sense.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:12.000
So we said that Rabia Bina Bina Bashir is introducing three major rules here.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.000
Number one.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.000
The Nusra of Hakeem Es-Saffat is an authoritative point.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:22.000
And therefore we know the reason for it is because it makes more sense.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.000
Right.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.000
So that's one point.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.000
Point number two.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.000
The presupposition.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.000
Why does it make no sense?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.000
Because you cannot have happiness outside.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.000
Yes.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.000
