00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.000
It's a revolutionary point that he's presenting.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.000
You see.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:57.000
Three revolutionary ideas presented by Rabbeinu Yonah.

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.000
